<title>USA: SweetWater cuts 30 pct of staff, sees delisting.</title>
<headline>SweetWater cuts 30 pct of staff, sees delisting.</headline>
<dateline>LONGMONT, Colo. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SweetWater Inc on Wednesday said it cut its staff by about 30 percent in a move to reduce overhead and preserve cash resources.</p>
<p>The company said it would concentrate its resources on its current portable water filtration and purification products.</p>
<p>It said it would continue to review cost-containment programs designed to reduce overhead and conserve its asset value while it assessed strategic alternatives with the assistance of Dillon Read &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
